---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "/index.html"
canonical: "/"
title: "Design by Cristina | Software & Digital Experiences for Service-Based Businesses"
description: "Design by Cristina: Beautifully designed software and digital experiences for service-based businesses, built with deep roots in aesthetics and wellness by a creative developer with 18+ years of experience."
---
{% from "prose-section.njk" import prose %}
{% set c = copy.index %}
<!-- ============ HERO / INTRODUCTION ============ -->
<section class="hero" style="padding-top:140px;">
  <div class="hero-photo"><img src="images/hero-portrait.jpg" alt="Woman working calmly on a laptop, hands typing"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-plain">Creative Developer</p>
    <h1>{{ c.hero.heading }}</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:.3em;">{{ c.hero.body }}</p>
    <p class="lede" style="font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-soft);opacity:.85;font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;">Built with deep roots in aesthetics and wellness.</p>
    <a href="{{ c.hero.button_url }}" class="btn btn-{{ c.hero.button_style | lower }}">{{ c.hero.button_text }}</a>
  </div>
</section>
<svg class="seam seam-dark" viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,30 C300,70 900,-10 1200,30 L1200,60 L0,60 Z"/></svg>

<!-- ============ SECTION 1: THE APP (FLAGSHIP) ============ -->
<section id="app">
  <div class="wrap app-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="leadin-editorial" style="margin-bottom:.6em;">{{ c.app.leadin_text }}</p>
      <h2>{{ c.app.heading }}</h2>
      <p class="lede-app"><span style="font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:#C2876F;">Clarafide</span> is a branded digital intake system made for wellness practices. Your clients complete their medical history, skin history, consent, and consultation forms from their phone before they ever sit in your chair.</p>
      <a href="{{ c.app.button_url }}" class="btn btn-{{ c.app.button_style | lower }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ c.app.button_text }}</a>
      <ul class="feature-row">
        <li>Branded with your logo and colors</li>
        <li>No login, no app download</li>
        <li>Allergies flagged at a glance</li>
        <li>Built around your practice's workflow</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="app-visual">
      <img src="images/app-client-photo.png" alt="Client filling out a form on their phone" class="app-photo">
      <img src="images/app-demo-screenshot.png" alt="Aqua Pura Spa client intake form on a phone" class="app-screenshot">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<svg class="seam seam-dark flip" viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,30 C300,70 900,-10 1200,30 L1200,60 L0,60 Z"/></svg>

<!-- ============ SECTION 2: SHOP ONLINE ============ -->
<section id="solutions" class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      {{ prose(c.solutions) }}
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>SaaS Tools</h3>
        <p>Ongoing software built for service-based businesses. More tools launching soon.</p>
        <span class="cardlink cardlink-inactive" aria-disabled="true">Shop the Collection &rarr;</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Standalone Tools</h3>
        <p>One-off tools built for staying consistent, without overcomplicating your day.</p>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--clay-deep);margin-top:.5em;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#C2876F" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:7px;" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/></svg>The Daily5 is free, my gift to you.</p>
        <p style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:.4em;">Prefer pen and paper? Grab the <a href="https://a.co/d/07wmx9iT" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--clay);text-decoration:underline;">Daily5 Notebook</a> on Amazon.</p>
        <a class="cardlink" href="https://all-hubs.teachery.co/all-hubs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop the Collection &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Beauty Industry Tools</h3>
        <p>Specialized resources for estheticians, spa owners, and beauty entrepreneurs, including aftercare cards, client intake forms, service menus, and full launch kits for new businesses.</p>
        <a class="cardlink" href="https://all-hubs.teachery.co/all-hubs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop the Collection &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>E-Books</h3>
        <p>Professional, editable e-books you can brand and resell, covering skincare, small-business basics, and productivity.</p>
        <a class="cardlink" href="https://www.amazon.com/stores/Aqua-Pura/author/B0D9LFTX1X" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop the Collection &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<svg class="seam" viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,30 C300,70 900,-10 1200,30 L1200,60 L0,60 Z"/></svg>

<!-- ============ SECTION 3: THE BRAND EDIT / SERVICES ============ -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="offer">
      <div>
        {{ prose(c.services) }}
      </div>
      <ul class="offer-list">
        <li><span class="offer-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><h4>Crafting Your Brand</h4><p>Defining a unique identity, consistent messaging, and a compelling visual presence.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="offer-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><h4>Web site Design</h4><p>Establishing an online presence that showcases your products or services effectively.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="offer-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><h4>Design Elements</h4><p>Developing or refining logos, color schemes, and visual systems.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="offer-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><h4>Marketing</h4><p>Strategizing campaigns and keeping brand consistency across every platform.</p></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<svg class="seam flip" viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,30 C300,70 900,-10 1200,30 L1200,60 L0,60 Z"/></svg>

<!-- ============ SECTION 4: A LITTLE ABOUT CRISTINA ============ -->
<section id="about" class="alt">
  <div class="wrap about">
    {{ prose(c.about) }}
  </div>
</section>
<svg class="seam" viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,30 C300,70 900,-10 1200,30 L1200,60 L0,60 Z"/></svg>

<!-- ============ SECTION 5: CONTACT ============ -->
<section id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        {{ prose(c.contact) }}
      </div>
      <form name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
        <p class="hidden" style="display:none;"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input id="name" type="text" name="name" required>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="email">Email Address</label>
          <input id="email" type="email" name="email" required>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
